{"title":"Lime","sourceTitle":"Lime/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"center\" style=\"background-color: #eee; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-color: #88acf5; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 85%; width: 90%; padding: 0.2em; margin: 0.5em auto; margin-left:0px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; padding-left: 10px\">\n<div style=\"margin-left: 10px; text-align: left;\">\n<p>Esta página foi verificada pela última vez para a versão do Vintage Story <b>1.20.10</b>.\n</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Lime/de\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Kalk (18% translated)\" lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">Deutsch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Lime\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Lime (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Lime/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Cal (18% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Lime/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Известь (55% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Lime/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"石灰 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<div style=\"float:right;\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Cal</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Lime.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/3/34/Lime.png/100px-Lime.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/34/Lime.png/150px-Lime.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/3/34/Lime.png/200px-Lime.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</div>\n<p><b>Lime</b> é um material utilizado na produção de água de cal para <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Leather_working#Step_1:_Limewater_or_Diluted_Borax\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Leather working\">trabalho com couro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Leather_working#Step_1:_Limewater_or_Diluted_Borax\" title=\"Leather working\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Quicklime\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Quicklime\">cal viva</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Quicklime\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quicklime\"> </a></span> para <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Plaster\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Plaster\">reboco</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Plaster\" title=\"Plaster\"> </a></span> ou <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Mortar\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Mortar\">argamassa</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mortar\" title=\"Mortar\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtendo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtendo</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Criação\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Criação</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Comércio\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Comércio</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Obtaining\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtendo\">Obtendo</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"Creation\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Cria.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Criação\">Criação</span></h3>\n<p>A cal é criada a partir de giz ou calcário <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rock#Stones\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rock\">pedras</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Rock#Stones\" title=\"Rock\"> </a></span>, triturando-os em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Quern\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Quern\">moinho manual</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Quern\" title=\"Quern\"> </a></span>. <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rock#Special_Use_of_Stones\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rock\">Pedras de mármore</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Rock#Special_Use_of_Stones\" title=\"Rock\"> </a></span> também pode ser usado.\n</p><p><br />\nVocê também pode moer <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Sea_shell\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Sea shell\">conchas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Sea_shell\" title=\"Sea shell\"> </a></span> para obter uma pequena quantidade de limão, embora as conchas do mar sejam principalmente colecionáveis ​​​​e para decoração.\n</p><p><span id=\"Trading\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Com.C3.A9rcio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Comércio\">Comércio</span></h3>\n<p>16 limas podem ser adquiridas em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Trading#Commodities\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Trading\">Comerciante de commodities</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading#Commodities\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span> por 1 a 3 <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rusty_gear\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rusty gear\">engrenagens</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Rusty_gear\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rusty gear\"> </a></span>, com entre 9 e 15 negociações em estoque por vez.\n</p><p><span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Limewater.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/f/f0/Limewater.png/32px-Limewater.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f0/Limewater.png/48px-Limewater.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/f0/Limewater.png/64px-Limewater.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"102\" data-file-height=\"102\" /></a></span> Água de cal: Adicione 1 cal a 1 litro de água para produzir 1 litro de água de cal. Água de cal é usada no <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Leather_working#Step_1:_Limewater_or_Diluted_Borax\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Leather working\">primeiro passo na produção de couro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Leather_working#Step_1:_Limewater_or_Diluted_Borax\" title=\"Leather working\"> </a></span>.</li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Quicklime.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/7/74/Quicklime.png/32px-Quicklime.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/74/Quicklime.png/48px-Quicklime.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/7/74/Quicklime.png/64px-Quicklime.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Quicklime\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Quicklime\">Cal viva</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Quicklime\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quicklime\"> </a></span>: Asse 2 limas a 825°C para fazer 1 cal virgem para produzir <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Plaster\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Plaster\">reboco</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Plaster\" title=\"Plaster\"> </a></span> ou <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Mortar\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Mortar\">argamassa</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mortar\" title=\"Mortar\"> </a></span>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #5E462A; color: #EAD3B3; border: 2px solid; border-color: #382B1E; text-align: center;\">Version\n</th>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #5E462A; color: #EAD3B3; border: 2px solid; border-color: #382B1E; text-align: center;\">Description\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #D1B296; text-align: center;\">v1.21.0\n</th>\n<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #CCBCAB; border-color: transparent;\">The ability to craft lime using a hammer in the crafting grid was removed in version 1.21.0 <sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.vintagestory.at/blog.html/news/v1210-story-chapter-2-redux-stable-r420/\">Official devlog</a> </span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Navegação Wiki</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>História antiga</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\">Guias</a><span style=\"display:none\">[[::Category:Guides| ]]</span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Frequently_Asked_Questions_(FAQ)\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\">Perguntas frequentes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Frequently_Asked_Questions_(FAQ)\" title=\"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Vintage_Story_Original_Soundtrack\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Vintage Story Original Soundtrack\">Trilha sonora</a><span style=\"display:none\"><